{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the eerie world of Cthulhu 1920, a strategic card game where sanity is your lifeline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988880/extras/dfe9992ea7fa57598eebd531661701a4.poster.avif?t=1769803040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988880/extras/dfe9992ea7fa57598eebd531661701a4.webm?t=1769803040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988880/extras/dfe9992ea7fa57598eebd531661701a4.mp4?t=1769803040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players navigate a grid-based playfield, battling enemies, collecting items, and using weapons and long forgotten artifacts to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player starts with a hero card, representing their character with unique abilities. The goal is to maintain your sanity while outmaneuvering opponents and defeating the horrors that lurk in the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple rules but deep strategic potential, Cthulhu 1920 offers a thrilling and immersive experience in the Lovecraftian\u00a0universe.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988880?t=1769803040","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988880?t=1769803040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988880/68fdab82c1f273673e43b79f43e17f9bbccc3b08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769803040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988880/68fdab82c1f273673e43b79f43e17f9bbccc3b08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769803040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},